### CLI Usage Patterns

The pipeline supports step-by-step execution with confirmation prompts:

```bash
# Split phase only (with confirmation)
uv run python main.py --split

# Translate phase only (with confirmation)
uv run python main.py --translate

# Insert phase only (with confirmation)
uv run python main.py --insert

# Full pipeline with confirmation at each step
uv run python main.py --split --translate --insert

# Full pipeline with automatic confirmation (bypass all prompts)
uv run python main.py --split --translate --insert --force-yes

# Custom batch size
uv run python main.py --split --translate --insert --batch-size 8 --force-yes
```

**Important CLI Parameters:**

- `--split`: Split input files from 0_inbox into sentences
- `--translate`: Translate split sentences to English
- `--insert`: Process through ElevenLabs and insert into database
- `--force-yes` or `-y`: Automatically answer 'yes' to all confirmation questions
- `--batch-size` or `-b`: Set batch size for translation (1-15, default: 12)

